 "remarks": "Perched on the top floor of historic Greenwich Lodge, this spacious one-bedroom blends classic character with crisp updates. Soaring 18-foot vaulted ceilings complement hardwood floors and western-facing windows that flood the home with light and frame unobstructed sunset and NYC skyline views. An eat-in kitchen offers generous room for dining and meal prep, and the smart layout supports both relaxed living and effortless entertaining. Building perks include a brand-new fitness center and a rooftop seating area with panoramic vistas. Additional conveniences: common laundry, a locked storage bin, bicycle storage, assigned parking, and pet-friendly policies. Just moments from Greenwich Avenue, enjoy immediate access to shops, restaurants, the public library, and the Metro-North station for an easy commute.",
